#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> Hub 业务 API（REST / SAP / MCP）须带 **per-subject Service API Token**（`Authorization: Bearer fa_at_...`）。\n"
"> Security context: [`security.md`](security.md) · Install: [`install.md`](install.md)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:22
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Layer                   | Role                                                                                                        |\n"
#| "| ----------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
#| "| **Service API Token**   | 绑定 `user` / `agent` subject；REST `Authorization: Bearer`；SAP `connect.auth_token`；MCP `/mcp` 同 Bearer |\n"
#| "| **CLI bootstrap**       | `anima token create --subject-id <id> --name bootstrap`（直连 PG，不经 HTTP）                               |\n"
#| "| **cloudflared**         | Outbound tunnel；single hostname → Hub `127.0.0.1:2658`（API + Web UI at `/web`）                           |\n"
#| "| **`http.host`**         | Hub listen bind (IP or resolvable hostname); default `127.0.0.1`; use `0.0.0.0` for LAN                     |\n"
#| "| **`http.cors_origins`** | Explicit cross-origin browser origins (dev:web, split UI/API reverse proxy); independent of Tunnel          |\n"
#| "| **Client settings**     | desktop / mobile shell / **browser Web** fill Hub URL and token in **Hub settings**                       |\n"
#| "| **Remote UI**           | Desktop / Mobile 默认从 Hub `/web/*` 加载 UI；见 [`architecture.md`](../concepts/architecture.md) Client UI |\n"
#| "| **PWA**                 | `/web/*` 支持 manifest + Service Worker；手机浏览器与 APK 共用 compact 布局                                 |\n"
msgid ""
"| Layer                   | Role                                                                                                        |\n"
"| ----------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **Service API Token**   | 绑定 `user` / `agent` subject；REST `Authorization: Bearer`；SAP `connect.auth_token`；MCP `/mcp` 同 Bearer |\n"
"| **CLI bootstrap**       | `anima token create --subject-id <id> --name bootstrap`（直连 PG，不经 HTTP）                               |\n"
"| **cloudflared**         | Outbound tunnel；single hostname → Hub `127.0.0.1:2658`（API + Web UI at `/web`）                           |\n"
"| **`http.host`**         | Hub listen bind (IP or resolvable hostname); default `127.0.0.1`; use `0.0.0.0` for LAN                     |\n"
"| **`http.cors_origins`** | Explicit cross-origin browser origins (dev:web, split UI/API reverse proxy); independent of Tunnel          |\n"
"| **Client settings**     | Desktop / mobile shell / **browser Web** fill Hub URL and token in **Hub settings**                       |\n"
"| **Remote UI**           | Desktop / Mobile 默认从 Hub `/web/*` 加载 UI；见 [`architecture.md`](../concepts/architecture.md) Client UI |\n"
"| **PWA**                 | `/web/*` 支持 manifest + Service Worker；手机浏览器与 APK 共用 compact 布局                                 |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 层级                   | 作用                                                                                                            |\n"
"| ----------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **Service API Token**   | 绑定 `user` / `agent` subject；REST `Authorization: Bearer`；SAP `connect.auth_token`；MCP `/mcp` 同上 |\n"
"| **CLI bootstrap**       | `anima token create --subject-id <id> --name bootstrap`（直连 PG，不经 HTTP）                                   |\n"
"| **cloudflared**         | 出站隧道；single hostname → Hub `127.0.0.1:2658`（API + Web UI 位于 `/web`）                                    |\n"
"| **`http.host`**         | Hub 监听绑定（IP 或可解析主机名）；默认 `127.0.0.1`；局域网用 `0.0.0.0`                                          |\n"
"| **`http.cors_origins`** | 显式跨源浏览器 origin（dev:web、分离式 UI/API 反向代理）；独立于 Tunnel                                         |\n"
"| **客户端设置**          | desktop / mobile shell / **浏览器 Web** 在 **Hub 设置** 中填写 Hub URL 与 token                               |\n"
"| **远程 UI**             | Desktop / Mobile 默认从 Hub `/web/*` 加载 UI；见 [`architecture.md`](../concepts/architecture.md) 的 Client UI |\n"
"| **PWA**                 | `/web/*` 支持 manifest + Service Worker；手机浏览器与 APK 共用 `compact` 布局                                   |\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "PWA（浏览器 Web）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:34
msgid ""
"**Secure context**：Service Worker 需要 HTTPS 或 `localhost`；Tunnel 终端应使"
"用 HTTPS 域名。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:34
msgid ""
"**Service Worker vs 安装**：SW 在普通浏览器标签页访问 `/web/*` 时即注册（生产"
"构建）；**不要求**「添加到主屏幕」。安装仅改变启动方式（独立窗口），离线能力"
"与标签页相同。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:34
msgid ""
"**安装（可选）**：手机浏览器访问 `/web/chat`，Chrome / Safari 支持「添加到主"
"屏幕」；生产构建会显示安装引导条（compact 布局、非已安装态）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:34
msgid ""
"**更新**：Hub 部署新 Web 静态产物后，已安装 PWA 会提示「新版本可用」；点击重"
"新加载后生效。壳层 JS 由 Workbox precache，`/web/config.json` 始终 `no-store`"
"（Hub URL 动态）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:34
msgid "**离线边界（两层）**："
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:34
msgid ""
"**壳层（SW）**：仅缓存 JS/CSS/HTML 等静态资源，保证断网时页面框架可加载。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:34
msgid ""
"**业务快照（IndexedDB）**：Chat / Task / Notification / Diary / Email 及 "
"Console 部分只读页（dashboard status、status config、semantic memory list "
"等）由 `shell-sdk/offline-cache` 做 cache-first 展示、在线 refresh 写回；**不"
"**经 SW 缓存 `/api` 或 `/sap`。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:34
msgid ""
"**离线只读**：浏览器 `offline` 时 shell-ui 显示全局提示并禁用各 satellite 写"
"操作；展示的是**曾在线拉取过的快照**，非 Hub 全量镜像。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:34
msgid ""
"**存储**：SW 缓存、localStorage（Hub 设置）、IndexedDB（业务快照）互不冲突；"
"清除站点数据会同时删除三者。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:36
msgid "仅 `GET /api/health`、CORS 预检、`/api/echo` 豁免认证。"
msgstr ""

