msgstr "缺少或错误的 token → HTTP `401` 或 SAP 连接关闭。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:151
#, no-wrap
msgid "5. MCP outbound (external agents query Hub data)"
msgstr "5. MCP 出站（外部 Agent 查询 Hub 数据）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:154
msgid ""
"Hub serves Streamable HTTP MCP Server at **`/mcp`**, exposing read-only "
"tools from ToolSets with `expose_mcp: true` (e.g. `memory_recall`, "
"`conversation_search`). External MCP clients (Cursor, Claude Desktop, etc.) "
"connect **without LLM relay**."
msgstr ""
"Hub 在 **`/mcp`** 提供 Streamable HTTP MCP Server，暴露 `expose_mcp: true` "
"的 ToolSet 中的只读工具（如 `memory_recall`、`conversation_search`）。外部 "
"MCP 客户端（Cursor、Claude Desktop 等）**无需 LLM relay** 即可连接。"

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:155
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# External agent example (Cursor mcp.json, etc.)\n"
"mcpServers:\n"
"  freeanima:\n"
"    url: http://127.0.0.1:2658/mcp\n"
"    headers:\n"
"      Authorization: \"Bearer fa_at_...\"\n"
msgstr ""
"# External agent example (Cursor mcp.json, etc.)\n"
"mcpServers:\n"
"  freeanima:\n"
"    url: http://127.0.0.1:2658/mcp\n"
"    headers:\n"
"      Authorization: \"Bearer <remote_auth.token>\"\n"

